	(text "R10: USART6 PC6/PC7 AF7 GPS; UART5 PB13/PB12 AF14 radio. Port EN and OE default low. EXTI10 GPS_FAULT_N; EXTI9 RADIO_FAULT_N; EXTI12 CAM_FAULT_N; EXTI4 LOGIC_SOURCE_ST (PA4), EXTI5 BAT_FAULT_N (PA5); VLOGIC_SENSE ADC on PA6 (D-R2-09). EXTI1 PE1 IMU_INT1 data-ready (R6-MCU-01)."
