	(text "Single screw switch: PC1 U1.16 ACT_EN_MCU drives R122 1k and Q122; initialise low before output mode. R123 100k holds the load switch off at reset. Disable synchronous trace (PC1 TRACED0, PE4 TRACED1); lock and read back both gate GPIO configurations."
